comment.narrative:
A total of 146 of schools and health centres have been connected to the&nbsp; internet under the project , &nbsp;representing 73% of the set target.

55 tertiary institutions have been connected to the internet with project support that was provided to GARNET. An estimated number of 250,000 students are using the service provided for learning and research in the beneficiary institutions.

91 Health centres/Institutions have been provided with last mile last connectivity under the broader Government wide network connectivity programme. &nbsp;

&nbsp;

&nbsp;

&nbsp;

The end target value has been reduced from &ldquo;600&rdquo; to &ldquo;315 (current value)&rdquo; due to cancellation of training budget to support Open Data initiatives.

The contract for the Data Specialist was not renewed. Previosly, NITA has developed a revamped Open Data Platform plan for retraining internal staff to ensure data upload onto the portal.

&nbsp;
